  "_evidence_model": "Every match is weighted by kind (import 8, entitlement 6, objc 5, identifier string 3, library 1, weak link 0, loose token 0) and, where a rule declares aspects, capped by what the primitive means (min of the two): a 'stat' import counts 2 under path-resolution, a 'mount' import counts 8. Sinks: >=10 HIGH, >=5 MEDIUM. Caller validation sums one hit per class: >=12 STRONG, >=5 MEDIUM, >0 WEAK."
